msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month, month and year."
msgstr "Livir tu kari roja rêkkewta (date) sîtemê biguhere."

#: dtime.cpp:147
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or seconds "
"field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down buttons to the "
"right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari demjimêra sîstemê biguhere. Bitikîne ser xana demjimêran, "
"hurdemanyan çirkan jibo ku tu nirxên wane biguherîne, herweha tu kari nirxan bi "
"dûgma jêr û jor biguherîne yanjî nirxên nuh binivîsîne."

